        "id": 47304,
        "name": "American Chopper",
        "summary": "Be hired into the shop of the hit TV series American Chopper. Here's your chance to ride the bikes built by the Teutuls. Choose from the POW/MIA Bike, Jet Bike, Black Widow Bike, and others. You're also sent on missions to create your very own, original themed chopper that rivals those built by Paul Sr. and Paul Jr. Experience first-hand all of the hard work, drama, and thrill of creating one of the most beautiful bikes on the road today.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/igvuatzgxvdwvcmpd07f.jpg",
        "release_date": 1103673600,
        "rating": 99.25925925925925,
        "rating_count": 36,
        "genres": "Racing",
        "platform_ids": "11,6,8",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/american-chopper",
        "cached_at": 1772208562
      },
      {
        "id": 379,
        "name": "Metal Gear Solid 3: Snake Eater",
        "summary": "Metal Gear Solid 3: Snake Eater is the prequel to the entire Metal Gear series. Most of the series' defining gameplay elements have been carried over and as before, Snake must use stealth and wits rather than brute force to infiltrate enemy zones and eliminate his major adversaries. Unlike the previous games, this installment takes place in a large outdoor jungle. Snake is able to use camouflage, climb trees, hide in tall grass or wear clothes that make him less noticeable.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ei5.jpg",
        "release_date": 1100649600,
        "rating": 92.58173445283595,
        "rating_count": 1205,
        "genres": "Shooter|Tactical|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "8",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/metal-gear-solid-3-snake-eater",
        "cached_at": 1772208562
      },
      {
        "id": 479,
        "name": "Metal Gear Solid 3: Subsistence",
        "summary": "Metal Gear Solid 3: Subsistence continues the Metal Gear Solid series tradition of follow-up enhanced, international version releases.\nSubsistence's online multiplayer component, titled Metal Gear Online, consists of five tournament-style game modes, each with a capacity of up to eight players. This mode pits players, each playing as a generic soldier against each other in deathmatch battles and variations of capture the flag, using stages, items, maneuvers, and units (such as the KGB, GRU or Ocelot Unit) from the main game.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1vd6.jpg",
        "release_date": 1135209600,
        "rating": 92.15306320313289,
        "rating_count": 343,
        "genres": "Shooter|Tactical|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "8",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/metal-gear-solid-3-subsistence",
        "cached_at": 1772208562
      },
      {
        "id": 22066,
        "name": "Silent Hill 2: Restless Dreams",
        "summary": "Silent Hill 2: Restless Dreams is an updated version of of Silent Hill 2. It contains all of the content of the original version and adds several pieces of new content. The most significant is a new short scenario called Born from a Wish, where players take control of Maria from her first moments right up to where she first appears in the main game. Also included is a sixth ending to the main scenario and a minor feature that allows the player to turn off the graphical effect, which makes the game look like it was shot on cheap film stock.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3weh.jpg",
        "release_date": 1008720000,
        "rating": 92.13965945358188,
        "rating_count": 43,
        "genres": "Puzzle|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "11,6,8",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/silent-hill-2-restless-dreams--1",
        "cached_at": 1772208562
      },
      {
        "id": 9143,
        "name": "Guilty Gear X2 #Reload",
        "summary": "As humanity endeavored to better themselves, they created the biological marvel known as Gears. Originally intended as the next step of human evolution, they were instead fitted for war and turned against their own creators.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co41if.jpg",
        "release_date": 1048636800,
        "rating": 91.46679268150405,
        "rating_count": 33,
        "genres": "Fighting|Arcade",
        "platform_ids": "52,11,6,38,12,8",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/guilty-gear-x2-number-reload",
        "cached_at": 1772208562
      },
      {
        "id": 9577,
        "name": "Persona 3",
        "summary": "Shin Megami Tensei: Persona 3 is a role-playing video game developed by Atlus. In the game, the player takes the role of a male high-school student who joins the Specialized Extracurricular Execution Squad (SEES), a group of students investigating the Dark Hour, a time period between one day and the next that few people are aware of. During the Dark Hour, the player enters Tartarus, a large tower containing Shadows, creatures that feed on the minds of humans. To fight the Shadows, each member of SEES is able to summon a Persona, a manifestation of a person's inner self. In addition to the standard elements of role-playing games, Persona 3 includes elements of simulation games, as the game's protagonist progresses day by day through a school year, making friends and forming relationships that improve the strength of his Personas in battle.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5mo6.jpg",
        "release_date": 1152748800,
        "rating": 91.45996771696716,
        "rating_count": 120,
        "genres": "Role-playing (RPG)|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "8",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/persona-3",
        "cached_at": 1772208562
      },
      {
        "id": 481,
        "name": "Silent Hill 2",
        "summary": "The second entry in the Silent Hill franchise, Silent Hill 2 is a narrative-focused third-person psychological survival horror game with emphasis on combat, exploration and puzzle-solving elements which follows James Sunderland, a man who receives a letter, seemingly sent by his three-years-deceased wife Mary, in which he is beckoned to the fog-ridden town of Silent Hill at the same time as numerous other people troubled by their past.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2vyg.jpg",
        "release_date": 1001289600,
        "rating": 91.44724120252442,
        "rating_count": 1130,
        "genres": "Puzzle|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "8",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/silent-hill-2",
        "cached_at": 1772208562
      },
      {
        "id": 7881,
        "name": "ESPN NFL 2K5",
        "summary": "ESPN NFL 2K5 is an American football video game developed by Visual Concepts for the PlayStation 2 and Xbox consoles. Published by Sega Sports and the Sega Corporation, it is the sixth installment of the NFL 2K series and the last to use official NFL licensing until an unnamed sequel is released in 2021. Gameplay is presented as a live ESPN television broadcast and features the voices and digital likenesses of multiple ESPN on-air personalities.\n\nThe game was originally released on July 20, 2004. It was the last NFL 2K game to be released before Electronic Arts (EA) signed an exclusive rights agreement with the National Football League (NFL) to make 2K's rival Madden NFL series the only officially licensed NFL game and was also the last game still being developed by Sega.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2xij.jpg",
        "release_date": 1090281600,
        "rating": 91.11219548634949,
        "rating_count": 25,
        "genres": "Simulator|Sport",
        "platform_ids": "11,8",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/espn-nfl-2k5",
        "cached_at": 1772208562
      },
      {
        "id": 1229,
        "name": "Xenosaga Episode III: Also sprach Zarathustra",
        "summary": "The story of Xenosaga III starts a year after \"Xenosaga II\" ended. Shion has resigned from Vector Industries after learning that the company is deeply connected to the appearance of the Gnosis. She instead joins Scientia, an underground organization working to unveil Vector's secrets in order to bring them down. Uncover the truth and save mankind in the finale of the Xenosaga series which boasts over 3 hours of movies, an updated battle system, and an improved customization feature with more in-depth character specialization and diversification and higher rewards for strategic party management. This RPG also includes an easily accessible database feature, the \"Xeno Bible\" and a mini-game with over 50 levels that challenges both you and your friends.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3fe3.jpg",
        "release_date": 1152144000,
        "rating": 90.21806508162703,
        "rating_count": 24,
        "genres": "Role-playing (RPG)|Turn-based strategy (TBS)|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "8",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/xenosaga-episode-iii-also-sprach-zarathustra",
        "cached_at": 1772208562
      },
      {
        "id": 732,
        "name": "Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas",
        "summary": "Returning after his mother's murder to the semi-fictional city of Los Santos (based on Los Angeles), Carl Johnson, a former gang banger, must take back the streets for his family and friends by gaining respect and once again gaining control over the streets. However, a story filled with crime, lies and corruption will lead him to trudge the entire state of San Andreas (based on California and Nevada) to rebuild his life.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2lb9.jpg",
        "release_date": 1098748800,
        "rating": 90.06531208981397,
        "rating_count": 3802,
        "genres": "Shooter|Racing|Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "11,9,48,34,6,39,14,12,8",
